-readers-viewpoint-jung-heewon-name-020","omniscient-readers-viewpoint-shin-yoosung-name-027"],"source_url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%A8%E7%9F%A5%E8%AE%80%E8%80%85%E8%A6%96%E8%A7%92"},{"question":"Which character is Dokja''s former colleague, pulled into the first scenario on the subway?","options":["Jung Heewon","Yoo Sangah","Lee Jihye","Bihyung"],"correct":1,"kind":"character","spoiler":{"arc":0,"scope":"both"},"fact_ids":["omniscient-readers-viewpoint-yoo-sangah-name-019","omniscient-readers-viewpoint-jung-heewon-name-020","omniscient-readers-viewpoint-lee-jihye-name-023","omniscient-readers-viewpoint-bihyung-name-026"],"source_url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%A8%E7%9F%A5%E8%AE%80%E8%80%85%E8%A6%96%E8%A7%92"},{"question":"Which character is the fearless woman who is not in the novel and wins a powerful sponsor?","options":["Yoo Sangah","Jung Heewon","Lee Jihye","Shin Yoosung"],"correct":1,"kind":"character","spoiler":{"arc":2,"scope":"both"},"fact_ids":["omniscient-readers-viewpoint-yoo-sangah-name-019","omniscient-readers-viewpoint-jung-heewon-name-020","omniscient-readers-viewpoint-lee-jihye-name-023","omniscient-readers-viewpoint-shin-yoosung-name-027"],"source_url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%A8%E7%9F%A5%E8%AE%80%E8%80%85%E8%A6%96%E8%A7%92"},{"question":"Which character is the tall, honest former soldier?","options":["Gong Pildu","Han Myungoh","Lee Gilyoung","Lee Hyunsung"],"correct":3,"kind":"character","spoiler":{"arc":0,"scope":"both"},"fact_ids":["omniscient-readers-viewpoint-lee-hyunsung-name-021","omniscient-readers-viewpoint-lee-gilyoung-name-022","omniscient-readers-viewpoint-gong-pildu-name-024","omniscient-readers-viewpoint-han-myungoh-name-025"],"source_url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%A8%E7%9F%A5%E8%AE%80%E8%80%85%E8%A6%96%E8%A7%92"},{"question":"Which character is the boy from the first subway car who later gains power over insects?","options":["Lee Gilyoung","Lee Hyunsung","Lee Jihye","Shin Yoosung"],"correct":0,"kind":"character","spoiler":{"arc":2,"scope":"both"},"fact_ids":["omniscient-readers-viewpoint-lee-hyunsung-name-021","omniscient-readers-viewpoint-lee-gilyoung-name-022","omniscient-readers-viewpoint-lee-jihye-name-023","omniscient-readers-viewpoint-shin-yoosung-name-027"],"source_url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%A8%E7%9F%A5%E8%AE%80%E8%80%85%E8%A6%96%E8%A7%92"},{"question":"Which character is the villain who leads the Building Owners'' League?","options":["Han Myungoh","Bihyung","Gong Pildu","Lee Hyunsung"],"correct":2,"kind":"character","spoiler":{"arc":0,"scope":"both"},"fact_ids":["omniscient-readers-viewpoint-lee-hyunsung-name-021","omniscient-readers-viewpoint-gong-pildu-name-024","omniscient-readers-viewpoint-han-myungoh-name-025","omniscient-readers-viewpoint-bihyung-name-026"],"source_url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%A8%E7%9F%A5%E8%AE%80%E8%80%85%E8%A6%96%E8%A7%92"},{"question":"Which character is the dokkaebi who runs a streaming channel and broadcasts the first scenario?","options":["Gong Pildu","Han Myungoh","Shin Yoosung","Bihyung"],"correct":3,"kind":"character","spoiler":{"arc":2,"scope":"both"},"fact_ids":["omniscient-readers-viewpoint-gong-pildu-name-024","omniscient-readers-viewpoint-han-myungoh-name-025","omniscient-readers-viewpoint-bihyung-name-026","omniscient-readers-viewpoint-shin-yoosung-name-027"],"source_url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%A8%E7%9F%A5%E8%AE%80%E8%80%85%E8%A6%96%E8%A7%92"},{"question":"Which character is the girl with rare taming abilities?","options":["Shin Yoosung","Lee Jihye","Lee Gilyoung","Jung Heewon"],"correct":0,"kind":"character","spoiler":{"arc":2,"scope":"both"},"fact_ids":["omniscient-readers-viewpoint-jung-heewon-name-020","omniscient-readers-viewpoint-lee-gilyoung-name-022","omniscient-readers-viewpoint-lee-jihye-name-023","omniscient-readers-viewpoint-shin-yoosung-name-027"],"source_url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%A8%E7%9F%A5%E8%AE%80%E8%80%85%E8%A6%96%E8%A7%92